{"title": "Legendary Action: Ptarian Dogma", "pageid": 45118, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Ptarian_Dogma", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters", "Legendary actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma.webp, /w/images/b/bf/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Ptarian Dogma</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris\" title=\"Ptaris\">Ptaris</a> in Honour mode which lets him pacify a foe that strikes him.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per round, after being hit, Ptaris can spend a Legendary Action to surround his attacker in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ptarian_Pacifism_(Condition)\" title=\"Ptarian Pacifism (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ptarian Pacifism\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ptarian_Pacifism_(Condition)\" title=\"Ptarian Pacifism (Condition)\">Ptarian Pacifism</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Ptarian_Pacifism\"> Condition: Ptarian Pacifism </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ptarian_Pacifism_(Condition)\" title=\"Ptarian Pacifism (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ptarian Pacifism\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ptarian_Pacifism_(Condition)\" title=\"Ptarian Pacifism (Condition)\">Ptarian Pacifism</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity's Strength, Dexterity and Constitution scores have been reduced by 4.</li>\n<li>It and nearby allies are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pacified_(Ptaris)_(Condition)\" title=\"Pacified (Ptaris) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pacified\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Legendary_Action_Ptarian_Dogma_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pacified_(Ptaris)_(Condition)\" title=\"Pacified (Ptaris) (Condition)\">Pacified</a>. Unless the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"50 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 50 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a> granted by this effect are removed, when the effect ends, one of Ptaris' Mental Image will appear.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris\" title=\"Ptaris\">Ptaris</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202832\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1150/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12814/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3718/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 121/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 687859/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.402      1 -total\n 99.05%   40.017      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 31.99%   12.923      1 Template:Cond\n 25.73%   10.397      2 Template:Icon_link\n 24.79%   10.014      2 Template:Icon_text\n 24.35%    9.836      1 Template:Condition\n 22.47%    9.079      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 21.93%    8.860      6 Template:Trim\n 17.18%    6.943      2 Template:Ifempty\n 11.43%    4.619      1 Template:Condition_full/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:45118-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202832 and revision id 272564. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}